  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="pq-section pq-section-black">
    <p class="pq-number">01 / WHY QUOTES?</p>
    <h2>SOMETIMES<br>ONE FUCKING<br>SENTENCE.</h2>
    <div class="pq-copy">
      <p>Sometimes somebody manages to put a whole uncomfortable idea into a sentence. You save it because it makes you recognize something, argue with something, or remember something you would rather not forget.</p>
      <p>You are not decorating the internet with inspirational wisdom. A good quote can be funny, harsh, useful, or completely at odds with what you believe. You get to decide what it means to you.</p>
      <div class="pq-callout">WHAT DID IT MAKE YOU NOTICE?<br>WHAT DID IT CHALLENGE?<br>WHY THE FUCK WOULD YOU KEEP IT?</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUOTES -->
  <section class="pq-library">
    <div class="pq-library-heading">
