  <!-- CATEGORIES -->
  <section class="pq-section pq-section-yellow">
    <p class="pq-number">03 / WHAT YOU KEEP COMING BACK TO</p>
    <h2>SAME QUESTIONS.<br>DIFFERENT<br>WORDS.</h2>
    <div class="pq-copy">
      <p>Apparently your brain has themes. So do the books you keep returning to.</p>
      <div class="pq-tags">

        <span>RECOVERY</span>

        <span>ADDICTION</span>

        <span>BIPOLAR</span>

        <span>SUFFERING</span>

        <span>IMPERMANENCE</span>

        <span>ANGER</span>

        <span>ACCOUNTABILITY</span>

        <span>IDENTITY</span>

        <span>COURAGE</span>

        <span>SHAME</span>

        <span>GRIEF</span>

        <span>CHANGE</span>

        <span>FREEDOM</span>

        <span>COMPASSION</span>

        <span>STARTING OVER</span>

        <span>CHAOS</span>

        <span>PERSEVERANCE</span>

        <span>PERSONAL RESPONSIBILITY</span>

      </div>
      <p>You can revisit the same question through completely different writers and still find something you had not considered before.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTEXT -->
  <section class="pq-section pq-section-purple">
    <p class="pq-number">04 / CONTEXT MATTERS</p>
    <h2>TEN WORDS<br>AREN'T THE<br>WHOLE BOOK.</h2>
    <div class="pq-copy">
      <p>A quote is a fragment, not a complete argument. It can be useful even when the rest of the book is uncomfortable, contradictory, or full of things you reject.</p>
      <div class="pq-thought">WHO SAID IT?<br>WHERE DID IT COME FROM?<br>WHAT WERE THEY ACTUALLY TALKING ABOUT?</div>
      <p>Context does not ruin a good quote. Usually it makes it more fucking interesting.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENDING -->
  <section class="pq-ending">
    <p>DON'T JUST SAVE THE WORDS.</p>
    <h2>ASK WHY<br>THEY FUCKING<br>MATTER.</h2>
    <p class="pq-ending-copy">Keep the ones that make you stop. Keep the ones you argue with. Keep the ones you need to find again.</p>
    <%= link_to "← BACK TO PERSPECTIVES", perspectives_path, class: "pq-back-link" %>
  </section>
</main>
